   "stem_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which two inequalities are graphed in the system of inequalities below?</span><br></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><img alt=\"GRAPH OF A SYSTEM OF INEQUALITIES WITH SOLID VERTICAL LINE THROUGH X EQUALS 2 AND SHADING TO THE RIGHT AND DOTTED LINE WITH Y\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"393\" src=\"exercises/media/9a7ef1c312d260d9.jpg\" width=\"384\"><br></span></p>",
   "answers": [
